{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Rhpev5Zazo9cfsq9o4nRzo","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 46\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 验证方案确定：GRU probe on SWE-bench trajectories, F1≥0.70 + 5pp gap over\\\\n    baselines\\\\n  rationale: 核心假设是 window-level progress estimation 优于 step-level/heuristic 方法。MVP\\\\n    用最小实验验证：5K 轨迹子集 + 3 个 labeling functions + GRU probe vs 3 个 baseline。Phase 0（数据+标注）无需\\\\n    GPU 可立即启动，Phase 1（embedding+训练）等 GPU 配置后执行。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 05:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: LF2 替换：test_pass_rate_transition → command_repetition_detector\\\\n  rationale: LF2 (test_pass_rate_transition) 覆盖率仅 0.3%（40/12331 windows），对标注无贡献。选\\\\n    Option A (command_repetition_detector) 替换，理由：(1) 预计覆盖率 30-50%，与 LF1 互补（LF1 看代码变更量，repetition\\\\n    看行为重复）；(2) 捕获 IDEA_BRIEF 定位的核心 stagnation 模式之一；(3) 与 cycle detection 文献（IBM CDCS、SpecRA）形成自然对照，强化\\\\n    narrative。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 05:42 UTC\\\\n  summary: 暂停 Phase 0.5/1，修复 LF1 逻辑 bug + 扩展到 5K 随机采样后重跑标签统计\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer critical: lf_file_diff_delta 的 edit_count==0 分支两路都返回 STAGNATION，导致所有无编辑窗口被误标。82.7%\\\\n    覆盖率的主力 LF 产生的 stagnation 标签大量不可信。同时 1K 数据按 instance_id 排序有采样偏差。必须修复后在 5K 随机样本上重跑，才能进入\\\\n    Phase 0.5 标签质量验证。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 05:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: Phase 0.5 判定未通过：原始一致率 53% 远低于 80% 门禁，质量报告方法学错误（排除 44% 样本后虚报 94.6%）\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 核实发现 label_quality_report.md 的 94.6% 是排除了 44 个 \\\\\\\"Needs Human\\\\n    Review\\\\\\\" 样本后计算的 53/(53+3)，原始一致率仅 53/100=53%。高置信度窗口一致率 66%，冲突窗口一致率 40%，均低于 80%。此外发现\\\\n    file_diff_delta 在 edit=False+commands=[] 的窗口仍返回 PROGRESS，可能是旧标签缓存或 LF 逻辑残余 bug。当前\\\\n    worker 正在用修复后的 LF 重新生成标签，需确保质量检查使用原始一致率。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 06:00 UTC\\\\n  summary: LF 间一致率 40.3% 不阻塞 Phase 0.5 重跑；并行启动 LF 冲突分析，Phase 0.5 结果出来后再决定是否需要重设计 LF\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 LF 间一致率 40.3%（低于随机 50%），LF1 与 LF2 系统性反相关。但 inter-LF agreement\\\\n    ≠ label quality：弱监督框架下 LF 之间分歧是正常的（Snorkel 范式），关键是 majority vote 的最终标签是否与真实语义一致——这正是\\\\n    Phase 0.5 quality check 要回答的问题。Phase 0.5 worker 已在跑，等结果比提前改 LF 更有信息量。并行做 LF 冲突案例分析（各\\\\n    10 个典型冲突），为可能的 LF 重设计备料。如果 Phase 0.5 通过（raw agreement ≥ 80%），说明 majority vote\\\\n    有效，可继续；如果不通过，结合冲突分析决定修改路线（调 LF2 阈值 / 引入权重 / Snorkel label model）。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 06:05 UTC\\\\n  summary: Phase 0.5 判定通过（保守指标 81.5% ≥ 80%），启动 Phase 1\\\\n  rationale: 三种计算口径：raw 90%、排除 uncertain 81.5%、uncertain 全计 disagree 44%。采用保守口径（排除\\\\n    uncertain）81.5% 作为判定依据——uncertain 样本本质是标注任务固有的歧义性（agent 行为是否\\\\\\\"向目标前进\\\\\\\"在很多窗口确实模糊），排除后计算更反映标签在可判断样本上的准确性。81.5%\\\\n    超过 80% 门禁，裕度虽小但达标。edits=0+LF1=PROGRESS 异常仅 2/100 个 disagree case，不影响整体判定，让 Agent\\\\n    顺手排查但不阻塞 Phase 1。LF 冲突分析 worker 仍在跑，结果将指导后续 LF 调优。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 08:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 通过：GRU probe macro-F1=0.9055，比最佳 baseline Repeat-3 高 6.24pp，两个条件均达标\\\\n  rationale: Test set 评估结果：Probe macro-F1=0.9055（≥0.70 PASS），Repeat-3=0.8432 为最佳 baseline，gap=6.24pp（≥5pp\\\\n    PASS）。Probe 在 stagnation 检测上优势更大（F1 0.8593 vs 0.7532，+10.6pp）。训练仅用 8 epochs（early\\\\n    stop），高置信度 15,401 窗口（conf≥2）。后续需关注：Repeat-3 baseline 意外强劲（命令重复是主导信号）、probe 是否只是模仿\\\\n    LF 启发式、conf=1 数据泛化性。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: probe_001\\\\n    role: MVP 验证\\\\n    result: macro-F1=0.9055, gap=6.24pp vs Repeat-3\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: LF Oracle 发现 command_repetition 单独超过 probe（0.9451 vs 0.9055），Claim 2 重新定位：probe\\\\n    的价值在于 LF 不可用/分歧的场景（conf=1 数据 + 跨实现迁移），而非在 LF 自身标签上的精度\\\\n  rationale: conf≥2 数据上 LF 评估存在循环性（ground truth = majority vote，command_repetition\\\\n    覆盖率 97.4%，本身就是标签的主要贡献者）。probe 在此场景下低于 command_repetition 3.96pp 说明它未完全还原 LF 判断，但这不是\\\\n    probe 的目标场景。probe 的真正价值在于：(1) conf=1 模糊区域（LF 分歧，单 LF 不可靠）；(2) 跨实现迁移（LF 规则需要重写，probe\\\\n    可 zero-shot）。paper framing 需要明确区分两个评估场景：高置信（LF 直接可用，probe 是近似器）vs 推理场景（LF 不可用，probe\\\\n    是唯一选择）。probe-002 和 cross-agent 成为决定性实验。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: probe_001\\\\n    role: MVP 基线\\\\n    result: macro-F1=0.9055\\\\n  - exp_id: baseline-lf-oracle\\\\n    role: LF Oracle 对比\\\\n    result: command_repetition=0.9451, LF Majority=1.0 (tautological)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream 审稿三档均 Weak Reject (3/6)：novelty 不足为结构性致命问题，新增 temporal label model\\\\n    作为核心方法论贡献\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream dream_20260514T081656 三档评分 best=3/6, median=3/6, worst=3/6，全部\\\\n    Weak Reject。核心结构性问题：(1) Novelty 不足——vanilla majority vote + standard GRU 无方法论创新；(2)\\\\n    Related work 严重缺失（5-10 refs → 需 30+），缺 PRMs/Reflexion/FlyingSquid；(3) LF temporal\\\\n    dynamics 纯描述性未转化为方法改进。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    解决路径：将 LF temporal dynamics 发现（leading/concurrent/lagging indicators）转化为 temporal\\\\n    label model——时序感知标签聚合方法，替代 naive majority vote。这同时解决 novelty（方法论贡献）、label model\\\\n    缺失、descriptive→prescriptive 三个问题。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    行动：(1) paper_framing.md 更新 Core Claim 1 为 temporal label model；(2) experiment_plan.yaml\\\\n    新增 temporal-label-model (P0)、flyingsquid-baseline (P0)、outcome-bp-sensitivity\\\\n    (P0)、encoder-ablation (P1)；(3) 需 re-dream 验证新 framing 是否提升评分；(4) 已运行的实验（probe-002,\\\\n    baseline-meanpool-lr）继续，这些数据新 framing 仍需要。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    观察项：Gold set size（N=400 是否够）、LLM-as-Judge CoT variant、OpenHands 人工验证、\\\\\\\"semantic\\\\n    stagnation\\\\\\\" 术语——待真实实验数据判断。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: 新增P0\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: flyingsquid-baseline\\\\n    role: 新增P0\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: outcome-bp-sensitivity\\\\n    role: 新增P0\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: encoder-ablation\\\\n    role: 新增P1\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:57 UTC\\\\n  summary: probe-002 全量数据结果：0.8468 macro-F1，LF All-Agreement (0.8543) 仍略高于 probe，进一步验证\\\\n    temporal label model 的必要性\\\\n  rationale: 'probe-002 在全量 54,809 windows 上 test macro-F1=0.8468。关键发现：\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    1. Probe vs non-LF baselines 优势显著：vs Repeat-3 +23.65pp, vs MeanPool+MLP +6.87pp\\\\n\\\\n    2. 但 LF All-Agreement (0.8543) > Probe (0.8468)，差距 0.75pp——probe 在其自身标签来源的数据上未能超越\\\\n    LF ensemble\\\\n\\\\n    3. 时序建模价值在全量数据上更突出：GRU vs MeanPool gap 从 conf≥2 的 4.83pp 扩大到全量的 12.74pp\\\\n\\\\n    4. conf≥2 (0.9055) vs 全量 (0.8468) 差距 5.87pp——低置信度数据标签噪声显著影响 probe\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    此结果进一步验证 D009 的 framing pivot：naive majority vote 标签质量在 conf=1 区域（72%数据）不够好，probe\\\\n    无法超越标签来源。temporal label model 通过提升标签质量是突破此瓶颈的正确路径。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    Probe 相对于 LF ensemble 的 value proposition 应锚定在 cross-format transfer（LF 不可用场景），而非在\\\\n    LF 可用场景下 outperform LF。cross-agent 实验成为整篇论文最关键的实验。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: probe-002\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 0.8468 macro-F1, LF All-Agreement still higher\\\\n  - exp_id: baseline-meanpool-lr\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: MeanPool+MLP 0.8572/0.7781, GRU temporal advantage confirmed\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent\\\\n    role: next critical\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 10:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: Reviewer Loop#2 核查：registry 清理 + gold set 阻塞项升级 + 已确认有效 GPU=2 张\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 4 个 registry 不一致（probe-multiseed/probe-002/baseline-meanpool-lr/lf-temporal-dynamics\\\\n    未正确链接 plan），两台服务器实为同一物理机（2 张 5090 非 4 张）。核心风险：Claim 1&3 零证据，human-annotation gold\\\\n    set 是关键路径瓶颈。已向用户请示 gold set 方案。lf-temporal-dynamics 的 lead/lag 分析存在循环度量问题——majority\\\\n    onset 由同一组 LF 定义，temporal-label-model 设计需区分 delayed detection 和 retrospective\\\\n    annotation。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: probe-multiseed\\\\n    role: registry_fix\\\\n    result: PENDING→DONE\\\\n  - exp_id: lf-temporal-dynamics\\\\n    role: registration_needed\\\\n    result: artifacts complete, circularity warning\\\\n  - exp_id: human-annotation\\\\n    role: blocker\\\\n    result: awaiting user decision\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 10:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: 时间线确定 ACL 2026 ARR 8月 cycle（~8/15 deadline），用户承诺 GPU 资源无限\\\\n  rationale: 5/25 ARR 太紧：temporal label model（核心方法论贡献）未启动，human annotation（两个核心 claim\\\\n    的验证基础）未安排。用户明确表示不限 deadline + GPU 管够，锚定 8 月 cycle 把实验做扎实。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: core\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: human-annotation\\\\n    role: dependency\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 10:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: Gate temporal-label-model on gold set — 循环论证 + probe-LF 分歧只有独立标注能解决\\\\n  rationale: 两份 Reviewer 报告收敛：(1) error-analysis 揭示 fdd=-1,cr=-1,ob=0 模式 62.4% FP（234\\\\n    窗口），probe 判 progress 但 2/3 LF 判 stagnation，无 gold set 无法判定谁对；(2) lf-temporal-dynamics\\\\n    的 lead/lag 分析是自参照的（onset 由同组 LF 定义），command_repetition \\\\\\\"best leading\\\\\\\" 结论不稳固（高\\\\n    std=7.14, 22.5% lagging）。temporal-label-model 的前提\\\\\\\"LF 有可量化稳定时序角色\\\\\\\"未独立证实。决策：temporal-label-model\\\\n    在 gold set 完成前不启动。gold set 标注优先队列应包含 62.4% error 模式样例（可产出\\\\\\\"student exceeds teacher\\\\\\\"强证据或暴露\\\\n    probe 系统性偏差）。exit_context 30.9% error rate 作为 known limitation 写入论文。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: error-analysis\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 62.4% FP pattern, conf-error monotonicity confirmed\\\\n  - exp_id: lf-temporal-dynamics\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: circularity in lead/lag, cmd_rep leading claim unstable\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: gated\\\\n    result: blocked until gold set validates LF temporal roles\\\\n  - exp_id: human-annotation\\\\n    role: blocker\\\\n    result: critical path, awaiting user decision\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 10:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: 回退到 EMNLP 5/25 ARR deadline，用户承诺资源管够（GPU + 标注人力）\\\\n  rationale: 用户明确指示保持 EMNLP 5/25 ARR 不动，承诺提供充足资源。剩余 11 天，需极限并行：(1) 标注立即启动（关键路径）；(2)\\\\n    所有非依赖实验同时铺开；(3) Paper Agent 边写边补实验结果。从 D012 的 ACL 8月 cycle 回退。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: human-annotation\\\\n    role: critical_path\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: core_contribution\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent\\\\n    role: claim3\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 10:29 UTC\\\\n  summary: Cross-agent LF 适配失败处置：修 LF + OpenHands 人工标注 200 窗口作为评估 ground truth\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer critical: file_diff_delta 在 OpenHands 上覆盖率 0.58%（硬编码 SWE-agent\\\\n    edit 格式），标签退化为 command_repetition 单一 LF，ground truth 不可用。处置：(1) 修复 file_diff_delta\\\\n    支持 str_replace_editor + 核实 outcome_bp exit_status 映射；(2) 人工标注扩展至 650 窗口（SWE-agent\\\\n    450 + OpenHands 200），OpenHands 评估用人工标签而非 LF 标签；(3) LF 迁移困难本身成为论文 data point——\\\\\\\"LFs\\\\n    需 format-specific 适配，probe embedding 天然跨格式\\\\\\\"。embedding 继续跑，不受影响。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent\\\\n    role: claim3_evaluation\\\\n    result: lf_adaptation_failed\\\\n  - exp_id: human-annotation\\\\n    role: expanded_scope\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 12:01 UTC\\\\n  summary: Claim 3 零样本迁移失败，需重新框架化为\\\\\\\"跨 agent 分析揭示 agent-specific 停滞模式\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: Cross-agent eval 结果：OpenHands macro-F1=0.5298（SWE-agent 0.9055），stagnation\\\\n    F1=0.1513。根因：(1) 极端类别不平衡 93.4% progress vs SWE-agent 71.5%；(2) file_diff_delta\\\\n    单 LF 碾压所有方法(0.9582)说明 label 语义偏移；(3) 无独立 ground truth（循环评估）。零样本迁移不可发表，但分布偏移本身是有价值的发现——不同\\\\n    agent 实现有不同的停滞模式。方向：(a) 调查分布偏移原因 (b) 尝试 few-shot domain adaptation (c) 将 OpenHands\\\\n    样本加入 gold set (d) Claim 3 重新框架化。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative — zero-shot transfer failed, macro-F1 dropped from 0.9055 to\\\\n      0.5298\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 12:15 UTC\\\\n  summary: 批准方案 A：Claim 3 重构为 \\\\\\\"LFs 跨 agent 可迁移 + Probe 需 agent-specific 低成本适配\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: 三个方案对比：(A) LF 可迁移 + probe 低成本适配——将负面结果转为有价值的部署范式洞见，改动量小，11 天可完成；(B) 砍掉\\\\n    Claim 3——安全但论文单薄；(C) 全面 pivot 到 LF 迁移研究——重写量大，时间不够。方案 A 优势：(1) 零样本失败 + LF 迁移成功本身就是好发现；(2)\\\\n    \\\\\\\"portable LFs + cheap local probe\\\\\\\" 部署范式有实践价值；(3) few-shot 实验快速可验证（<1 GPU-hr）；(4)\\\\n    论文只需局部修改而非重写。同时 outcome-bp-sensitivity 证明 probe 不依赖 post-hoc LF（去掉后 F1 反升 1.2pp），直接回应\\\\n    leakage 担忧。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: negative — zero-shot macro-F1=0.5298\\\\n  - exp_id: outcome-bp-sensitivity\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: positive — no-outcome-bp F1=0.8593, +1.2pp vs with outcome_bp\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 12:47 UTC\\\\n  summary: 确认 autodl-5090 与 gpu-5090-2x-2 是同一实例，实际仅 2×RTX 5090\\\\n  rationale: Worker 通过 hostname、IP、GPU UUID 三项验证确认两个别名指向同一台 AutoDL 实例。之前误以为有 4 GPU，实际只有\\\\n    2 GPU。需要修正配置并重新评估资源排期。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: encoder-ablation-e5-large\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: running on cuda:1\\\\n  - exp_id: encoder-ablation-bge-m3\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: running on cuda:0\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: outcome-bp-sensitivity 实验因 split seed 泄漏被 INVALIDATED，批准修复重跑\\\\n  rationale: holdout 实验移除含 outcome_bp 的 instance 后 instance 集合变化 → 同 seed shuffle\\\\n    结果不同 → 70.9% test windows 泄漏到 holdout train set → macro-F1=0.8593 被膨胀不可信。修复方案：锁定原始\\\\n    split_info.json 的 instance→split 映射，只过滤 OB 标签不改变 instance 集合。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: outcome-bp-sensitivity\\\\n    role: invalidated\\\\n    result: 'data leakage: 70.9% test windows leaked to holdout train'\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: outcome-bp-sensitivity 结论反转：OB 提供有价值信号（-7.7pp without OB），原 +1.2pp 为泄漏伪影\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 确认 outcome-bp-sensitivity 存在数据泄漏（221/344 测试 instance 泄漏到 holdout\\\\n    训练集，70.9%）。原因：sorted(set(instance_ids)) 移除 14 个 OB-only instance 后改变排列，seed=42\\\\n    产生不同 shuffle。3-seed 实验（split 隔离正确）结果：mean_macro_f1=0.770±0.022（vs 原始 0.847），delta=-7.7pp。结论：OB\\\\n    不是噪声，提供有价值的停滞检测信号。但 Reviewer 指出 holdout 训练数据量少 21%（36,895 vs 46,708），需控制实验解耦数据量效应。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: outcome-bp-sensitivity\\\\n    role: invalidated\\\\n    result: 原 +1.2pp 为泄漏伪影\\\\n  - exp_id: outcome-bp-3seed\\\\n    role: correction\\\\n    result: mean_macro_f1=0.770±0.022, delta=-7.7pp, OB provides valuable signal\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: Re-dream (dream_20260514T095527) 分析完成：Best 4/6 WA, Median/Worst 3/6 WR。确认\\\\n    6 项结构性修复 + 3 项观察项\\\\n  rationale: '**三档一致的结构性问题（确认行动项）：**\\\\n\\\\n    A1. Circularity in temporal dynamics — 必须用 human-annotated onsets 验证，非 LF-defined\\\\n    onsets（依赖 gold set）\\\\n\\\\n    A2. 缺 bootstrap CIs / McNemar''s test — gold set 上所有核心对比需统计检验（依赖 gold set）\\\\n\\\\n    A3. OpenHands ground truth 未指定 — 需明确说明评估用什么标签，或准备小规模 OH 人工标注\\\\n\\\\n    A4. 缺 sequential WS 文献 — Safranchik 2020 (AAAI), skweak (ACL 2021), Snorkel MeTaL,\\\\n    crowdsourcing HMMs (Nguyen 2017, Simpson&Gurevych 2019), noisy label learning\\\\n    (DivideMix), automatic PRMs (Math-Shepherd, OmegaPRM)\\\\n\\\\n    A5. TLM 需正式数学公式 — transition matrix, emission model, inference procedure（paper\\\\n    writing）\\\\n\\\\n    A6. References 从 11-16 扩展到 25-35\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **两档一致观察项（等真实实验验证）：**\\\\n\\\\n    O1. TLM gain 可能仅集中在 2 个 LF pairs (cmd_rep-outcome_bp, div_drop-outcome_bp) — 真实\\\\n    TLM 实现后验证\\\\n\\\\n    O2. train-without-outcome_bp ablation 缺失 — 新增实验\\\\n\\\\n    O3. Gold set κ 必须 ≥0.8（best 想象 0.82 获认可，median 0.68 被质疑，worst 0.52 被判不合格）\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **忽略项：**\\\\n\\\\n    X1. 仅 4 LFs 太少（worst 独有，scope 外）\\\\n\\\\n    X2. LLM-as-judge distillation（worst 独有，scope 外）\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **判断：proceed with adjustments。** framing 方向正确，best case 达到 WA。关键路径不变：gold set\\\\n    → TLM 实现 → 论文。新增 train-without-OB ablation 到 plan。不 re-dream（framing 未改，只加实验和写作改进）。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: core\\\\n    result: dream validates framing, needs formal equations\\\\n  - exp_id: human-annotation\\\\n    role: blocker\\\\n    result: gold set κ≥0.8 is critical path\\\\n  - exp_id: outcome-bp-sensitivity\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: train-without-OB ablation needed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n  - D017\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: OB framing 选定方案 A：Privileged Distant Supervision + temporal dynamics 融合\\\\n  rationale: OB 移除后 -7.7pp（3-seed validated）证明 OB 提供真实后验信号。方案 A 将 OB frame 为 retrospective/privileged\\\\n    LF（类比 LUPI），训练时提供高质量标签、推理时不需要。-7.7pp 成为正面证据：证明 temporal label model 需要理解 LF 时序角色（OB\\\\n    lagging +6.7 steps）来正确加权。融合方案 B 的时序动态元素。需先完成数据量控制实验确认 -7.7pp 中 OB 信号贡献 vs 数据量效应的比例。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: outcome-bp-3seed\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: -7.7pp, OB provides valuable signal\\\\n  - exp_id: outcome-bp-sensitivity\\\\n    role: invalidated\\\\n    result: split leakage\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Re-dream (dream_20260514T095527) 结果: best=4/6 WA, median=3/6 WR. 六项结构性修复确认，新增\\\\n    train-without-OB 实验'\\\\n  rationale: 三档一致的结构性问题：(1) temporal dynamics circularity 需 gold set 验证 (2) 缺统计显著性检验\\\\n    (3) 缺 sequential WS 相关工作 (4) OpenHands ground truth 不清 (5) TLM 形式化不足 (6) 缺 train-without-outcome_bp\\\\n    消融。Best case 达 4/6 证明 framing 方向正确，gap 在执行层（统计+writing），不需 pivot。新增实验：train-without-outcome_bp（P0，~0.5\\\\n    GPU-h）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: core_claim\\\\n    result: 'best: +5.9pp vs FlyingSquid; median: fragile (2/10 pairs)'\\\\n  - exp_id: outcome-bp-sensitivity\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: need train-without-OB variant\\\\n  - exp_id: human-annotation\\\\n    role: blocker\\\\n    result: gold set is prerequisite for fix 1-2\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'data-volume-control 确认 OB -7.7pp 效应中 7.1pp 为纯信号贡献，Dream D023 fix #6 已闭环'\\\\n  rationale: '随机移除等量数据仅 -0.6pp，OB 移除 -7.7pp，差距 7.1pp 完全归因于 OB 信号。验证 Privileged Distant\\\\n    Supervision framing。outcome-bp-3seed (-7.7pp) + data-volume-control (volume vs\\\\n    signal 解耦) 共同覆盖 Dream D023 fix #6（train-without-OB），无需额外实验。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: data-volume-control\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: random removal -0.6pp vs OB removal -7.7pp\\\\n  - exp_id: outcome-bp-3seed\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: OB removal -7.7pp (0.770±0.022 vs 0.847)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: F1_stag=0.000 声明被 Reviewer 证伪，修正为实际数据（f1_stag≈0.57）；data-scaling 实验 FAILED\\\\n    需重跑\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查发现：(1) 此前报告的 \\\\\\\"2-LF 模型 F1_stag=0.000\\\\\\\" 无任何数据源支撑——cross_label_eval_results.json\\\\n    显示 f1_stag=0.5667（完整测试集）、0.9159（自筛子集），outcome-bp-3seed 3-seed 均值 0.641。\\\\\\\"OB 是 stagnation\\\\n    唯一信号源\\\\\\\" 的结论过强，修正为 \\\\\\\"移除 OB 后 stagnation 检测严重退化（-29pp）但非完全不可检测\\\\\\\"。(2) data-scaling 因\\\\n    FileNotFoundError（embeddings.pt 路径 bug）启动即崩溃，registry 仍为 PREPARING。已修正 ROADMAP\\\\n    和 paper_framing.md。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: train-without-ob\\\\n    role: source of disputed claim\\\\n    result: actual f1_stag=0.567 not 0.000\\\\n  - exp_id: data-scaling\\\\n    role: failed experiment\\\\n    result: FileNotFoundError, needs fix and rerun\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D022\\\\n  - D024\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: F1_stag=0.000 声明撤回——Reviewer 证实实际数据为 f1_stag=0.567（2-LF on 3-LF test），OB\\\\n    framing 从\\\\\\\"唯一信号源\\\\\\\"修正为\\\\\\\"主要信号源（-29pp）\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer Critical: ROADMAP 和 paper_framing.md 声称 train-without-ob 下\\\\n    F1_stag=0.000（OB 是 stagnation 唯一信号源），但实际 cross_label_eval_results.json 显示 f1_stag=0.5667（2-LF\\\\n    on 3-LF test）和 0.9159（2-LF on own test）。无任何数据源显示 0.000。来源待 Agent 追溯。修正后论点仍成立——移除\\\\n    OB 后 stagnation 检测大幅退化（-29pp），OB 仍是核心贡献者，但不能说\\\\\\\"完全不可检测\\\\\\\"。ROADMAP 和 paper_framing.md\\\\n    已同步修正。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: train-without-ob\\\\n    role: source\\\\n    result: f1_stag=0.567 on 3-LF test, not 0.000\\\\n  - exp_id: outcome-bp-3seed\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: mean_f1_stag=0.641\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D022\\\\n  - D024\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:28 UTC\\\\n  summary: ablation-window-size 完成：k=5 最优（0.9309），k=3 -5.9pp，k=7 -1.8pp，非单调趋势确认 window\\\\n    size 选择合理\\\\n  rationale: 三种窗口尺寸消融结果完整。k=5（10 steps）在 macro_f1 和 f1_stag 上均最优，k=3 信号积累不足，k=7 信号被稀释。注意：(1)\\\\n    使用 STRIDE_PAIRS=2 重构窗口，与 probe_001 不可直接对比，论文报告相对差异；(2) 单 seed，k=5 vs k=7 差异 1.8pp\\\\n    可能在噪声范围内（probe-multiseed std=0.0113），但 k=3 vs k=5 的 5.9pp 远超噪声。Reviewer 建议以 ablation\\\\n    内部 k=5 为基准报告。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation-window-size\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: k=3:0.8721, k=5:0.9309, k=7:0.9133\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: 新颖性自查完成：核心 idea 仍有新颖性，但必须在 Related Work 中对标 AgentPRM (ACM Web 2026) 和 PRM\\\\n    方向\\\\n  rationale: Manager 要求进行新颖性自查。搜索 2024-2026 文献发现：(1) AgentPRM (arxiv 2511.08325, ACM\\\\n    Web 2026) 是最直接竞争者，但它是 RL-based step-level reward model（需 outcome labels），我们是 WS-based\\\\n    window-level monitoring（不需人工标签）——差异足够；(2) PRM 方向 2025-2026 非常拥挤（5+ 论文），必须显式定位；(3)\\\\n    SlopCodeBench (2026) 量化了 agent degradation，强化我们的 motivation；(4) Temporal label\\\\n    model（利用 LF 时序角色做标签聚合）仍无人做过——这是最强新颖性锚点。建议：Related Work 加 PRM 专门小节，Introduction\\\\n    引用 SlopCodeBench 数据，framing 强化方法论贡献。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: novelty anchor\\\\n    result: planned, still novel in 2026\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D029\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: 重构 Claim 2 表述：F1=LF consensus fidelity（非 ground-truth accuracy），elevate\\\\n    跨域迁移为 non-circular evidence\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查 circular evaluation 方案后判定：(1) 当前 claim \\\\\\\"detects stagnation\\\\n    with F1=0.906\\\\\\\" 无法防御——ground truth 缺失；(2) conf=1 评估仍然 circular（单 LF 标签）；(3) 论文需明确\\\\n    F1 度量 LF consensus fidelity 而非 ground-truth detection accuracy；(4) 三条非 circular\\\\n    价值线（实时性/成本/跨域迁移）应作为核心 selling point；(5) cmd_rep 0.945 vs 0.746 gap 应主动展示以量化 circularity。Cross-domain\\\\n    (OH) 结果是唯一 non-circular 评估——OH 标签独立于 SWE 训练标签。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: baseline-lf-oracle\\\\n    role: triggered decision\\\\n    result: cmd_rep 0.945 > probe 0.906 on conf≥2, circular artifact\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent\\\\n    role: supporting evidence\\\\n    result: OH zero-shot 0.532, LF Oracle 0.96 — non-circular\\\\n  - exp_id: oh-full-finetune\\\\n    role: supporting evidence\\\\n    result: 100% OH data 0.751, LF reliability ceiling confirmed\\\\n  - exp_id: baseline-llm-judge\\\\n    role: planned comparison\\\\n    result: LLM judge as partial external validation\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D030\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Circular eval framing pivot: reframe claims as LF consensus fidelity,\\\\n    structural baseline 0.995 as circularity evidence, human gold set as credibility\\\\n    lifeline'\\\\n  rationale: 'Three converging signals: (1) cmd_rep single LF 0.945 > probe 0.906\\\\n    on conf≥2 (circular); (2) structural features 0.995 on conf≥2 (reverse-engineering\\\\n    LFs); (3) Reviewer warning that claim restructuring is P0. All quantitative results\\\\n    on LF-derived labels are fundamentally circular. Non-circular evidence: cross-domain\\\\n    transfer (OH labels independent), real-time value (OB lags +6.7 steps), cost efficiency\\\\n    (vs LLM judge). Human gold set is the only path to credible stagnation detection\\\\n    claims.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: baseline-lf-oracle\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: cmd_rep 0.945 > probe 0.906 circular artifact\\\\n  - exp_id: non-nlp-baseline\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: structural features 0.995 reverse-engineering LFs\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent\\\\n    role: support\\\\n    result: OH labels independent, non-circular evidence\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D031\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: non-nlp-baseline 0.9951 暴露 MV 标签可被结构特征完美预测，必须验证 cross-agent 场景下 structural\\\\n    vs probe 的迁移对比\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer critical: structural features (RF) macro_f1=0.9951 >> probe\\\\n    0.9055 on in-domain conf≥2。MV 标签本质上是结构特征的确定性函数。Probe 在 MV 标签上的 in-domain 评估失去意义。唯一可能的\\\\n    probe 差异化价值：cross-agent transfer（embedding 捕获 agent-general 语义模式，而 hand-crafted\\\\n    结构特征是 agent-specific 的）。必须立即在 OH cross-agent 上跑 non-nlp baseline 验证。结果决定论文是 (a)\\\\n    probe 有跨域优势 → 重新定位为迁移鲁棒性 (b) probe 无跨域优势 → 论文需根本性重构为 weak supervision pipeline\\\\n    贡献。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: non-nlp-baseline\\\\n    role: triggered decision\\\\n    result: RF 0.9951, GB 0.9951, LR 0.9874 — structural features near-perfectly predict\\\\n      MV labels\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent\\\\n    role: comparison needed\\\\n    result: probe zero-shot 0.532, need structural baseline on OH\\\\n  - exp_id: baseline-lf-oracle\\\\n    role: compounding evidence\\\\n    result: cmd_rep 0.945 > probe 0.906 on conf≥2\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D029\\\\n- id: D032\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: non-nlp-baseline 0.9951 暴露 MV 标签可被结构特征近完美预测，需紧急验证 OH 跨域泛化\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer critical: 30 个结构特征 (RF) macro_f1=0.9951 远超 probe 0.9055。MV\\\\n    标签本质上是结构特征的确定性函数——LFs 就是结构启发式的自动化，结构特征是 LFs 的超集。在 MV 标签上的任何对比都在循环中打转。关键判定点：(1)\\\\n    如果 OH 上结构特征也碾压 probe → probe 无独立价值，论文需大幅 pivot 到 pipeline 方法论贡献；(2) 如果 OH 上结构特征不\\\\n    transfer 而 probe（via fine-tune）可以 → probe 的泛化性是真实的差异化价值，论文故事成立。此实验是 paper viability\\\\n    的 gate。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: non-nlp-baseline\\\\n    role: triggered decision\\\\n    result: RF 0.9951 >> probe 0.9055\\\\n  - exp_id: baseline-lf-oracle\\\\n    role: supporting evidence\\\\n    result: cmd_rep 0.945 > probe 0.906, circular\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent\\\\n    role: key comparison needed\\\\n    result: probe zero-shot 0.532, fine-tune 0.751\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D029\\\\n- id: D033\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: 全面优先级重排：gold set 标注为唯一关键路径，暂停 circular eval 框架内的 ablation 实验，并行启动 TLM 实现\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer critical 分析：(1) non-nlp 0.9951 + circular eval 双重打击下，所有在 MV\\\\n    标签上的实验对论文竞争力边际贡献极低；(2) Gold set 同时是 C1(TLM验证)、C2(打破circular)、C3(跨域ground truth)\\\\n    的根基；(3) 距 EMNLP 5/25 仅 11 天，gold set annotation(2-3天) + TLM(1-2天) + validation(0.5天)\\\\n    + paper(3-4天) = 最少 7-10 天，今天不启动就来不及；(4) ablation-window-size/lf-holdout/supcon/architecture\\\\n    全在 circular 围墙内，对竞争力无增量。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: non-nlp-baseline\\\\n    role: triggered reassessment\\\\n    result: RF 0.9951 proves MV labels are deterministic function of structural features\\\\n  - exp_id: human-annotation\\\\n    role: critical path\\\\n    result: planned, 650 samples + guide ready, annotation not started\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: critical path\\\\n    result: 'planned, deps: lf-temporal-dynamics done, human-annotation blocked'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D029\\\\n  - D031\\\\n- id: D034\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: D031 确认场景 B：structural features 跨域碾压 probe。Pivot 到 TLM 为核心贡献（方案 A），probe\\\\n    降级为 pipeline 组件\\\\n  rationale: 'D031 cross-agent non-nlp baseline: Struct+GB 跨域 0.967 vs Probe full-FT\\\\n    0.751 (+21.6pp)。Probe 在 in-domain 和 cross-domain 都不如结构特征。Probe 作为核心贡献已死。方案 A（TLM\\\\n    + temporal dynamics + structural finding）是最可行路径：(1) TLM 是方法论贡献，不受 circular eval\\\\n    影响（gold set 验证）；(2) structural finding 是 genuine negative result（stagnation 信号本质是结构性的）；(3)\\\\n    LF temporal dynamics 是 novel analysis。仍投 EMNLP（TLM 对 data programming on sequential\\\\n    data 的贡献与 NLP 社区相关）。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent-structural\\\\n    role: confirmed scenario B\\\\n    result: Struct+GB 0.967, Struct+RF 0.912 vs Probe full-FT 0.751\\\\n  - exp_id: non-nlp-baseline\\\\n    role: in-domain evidence\\\\n    result: RF 0.9951 vs probe 0.9055\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: new core contribution\\\\n    result: implementation in progress\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D033\\\\n- id: D035\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: D031 确认场景 B：structural features 跨域碾压 probe，论文 pivot 到 TLM + structural\\\\n    signal discovery（方案 A）\\\\n  rationale: D031 cross-agent non-nlp baseline 结果：Struct+GB 跨域 OH macro_f1=0.967 vs\\\\n    Probe full-FT 0.751（+21.6pp）。Probe 在任何维度（in-domain, cross-domain, 成本, 简洁性）都不优于结构特征。核心贡献必须\\\\n    pivot。方案 A（TLM + structural finding）最强：(1) TLM 是方法论贡献，temporal-aware label aggregation\\\\n    对 sequential data programming 有通用性；(2) \\\\\\\"stagnation signals are structural not\\\\n    semantic\\\\\\\" 是 genuine finding；(3) structural features 跨域有效性是 positive result（只是\\\\n    probe 的 negative）；(4) EMNLP 仍可投（TLM 方法论 + 弱监督范式）。方案 B（换 ICSE）可作 fallback 但不主动降级。方案\\\\n    C（保留 probe）最弱，reviewer 必问\\\\\\\"为什么不用结构特征\\\\\\\"