{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XiXjhrkrVgHsc3UachUf2n","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-14 (Session #4)\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中 Worker（5 个）\\\\n- worker_analysis_bootstrap-crossdomain-fix（CPU，跨域 paired bootstrap 修复）\\\\n- worker_multiseed_e5large-probe（GPU cuda:0，E5 3-seed 训练）\\\\n- worker_multiseed_bgem3-probe（GPU cuda:1，BGE-M3 3-seed 训练）\\\\n- worker_paper_writing_related_work（CPU，Related Work 章节）\\\\n- worker_paper_writing_conclusion_abstract（CPU，Conclusion + Abstract + Limitations）\\\\n\\\\n## 已完成（Session #3 末 → #4 初）\\\\n- Introduction.tex 写入 docs/paper/sections/（~45行，3 claims 对齐 D039）\\\\n- E5-large 3-seed: 0.9381 ± 0.002 macro-F1（registry 已更新）\\\\n- Analysis.tex v2 完成（~500 词，4 subsection）\\\\n- main.tex 加 enumitem 包\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- 🔴🔴 用户确认标注人力 → 启动 650 窗口 gold set 标注（GO/NO-GO gate，最晚 5/16）\\\\n- Introduction 红色引用 `chen2025monitoring` 待替换\\\\n- Introduction 5 个新 bib entry 待添加\\\\n- method.tex Table 1 fire rate 填写（file_diff SWE 57.3%/OH 42.1%, outcome_bp SWE 23.9%/OH 19.8%）\\\\n- Appendix 内容规划\\\\n\\\\n## 论文章节进度\\\\n| 章节 | 状态 |\\\\n|------|------|\\\\n| Abstract | ⏳ Worker 运行中 |\\\\n| Introduction | ✅ 草稿（1 红色引用待修） |\\\\n| Related Work | ⏳ Worker 运行中 |\\\\n| Method | ✅ 完成 |\\\\n| Experiments | ✅ 完成 |\\\\n| Analysis | ✅ 完成 |\\\\n| Conclusion | ⏳ Worker 运行中 |\\\\n| Limitations | ⏳ Worker 运行中 |\\\\n| Appendix | ❌ 未开始 |\\\\n\\\\n## 实验总览\\\\n50 registry / 50 DONE (24+ success, 6 negative, 10 killed) / 0 RUNNING\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **E5-large 3-seed**: 0.9381 ± 0.002（极稳定）\\\\n- **paired-bootstrap**: 3 个 in-domain p<0.001，跨域修复 Worker 运行中\\\\n- **structural-data-scaling**: 10%→100% 完整曲线\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nbjb2-23165: cuda:0 (e5 multiseed), cuda:1 (bgem3 multiseed)\\\\nWorker 池: 5 (